獄辭，乃謝曰：「吏［事］方驗而出之。」於是使使持節赦絳侯，復爵邑。絳侯既出，曰：「吾嘗將百萬軍，然安知獄吏之貴乎！」","source_term":"公主者，孝文帝女也"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji057-006","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"dkv_2n9_bw6"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003510"]},{"id":"ycd_ixa_ovp_A","label":"勝之（絳侯周勃世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"太子勝之","mention_ids":["c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0114"]},{"surface":"勝之","mention_ids":["c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0020"]},{"surface":"絳侯勝之","mention_ids":["c-shiji-057-zhou:m012-0135"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0114","chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p010","quote":"太子勝之"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p011","quote":"勝之"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m012-0135","chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p012","quote":"絳侯勝之"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p011","quote":"絳侯復就國。孝文帝十一年卒，謚為武侯。子勝之代侯。六歲，尚公主，不相中，坐殺人，國除。絕一歲，文帝乃擇絳侯勃子賢者河內守亞夫，封為條侯，續絳侯後。","source_term":"子勝之代侯"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji057-001","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003469"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-057","chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0097","c-shiji-057-zhou:m010-0103","c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0029"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-057-zhou:p010","c-shiji-057-zhou:p011"],"passage_count":2}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-057-zhou"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotate