","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p011","text":"絳侯復就國。孝文帝十一年卒，謚為武侯。子勝之代侯。六歲，尚公主，不相中，坐殺人，國除。絕一歲，文帝乃擇絳侯勃子賢者河內守亞夫，封為條侯，續絳侯後。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"絳侯","kind":"person","person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkv_2n9_bw6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"勝之","kind":"person","person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"公主","kind":"person","person_id":"dkv_2n9_bw6_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkv_2n9_bw6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"絳侯勃","kind":"person","person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"亞夫","kind":"person","person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:m011-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"絳侯","kind":"person","person_id":"ycd_ixa_ovp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-057","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-057","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou","source":{"title":"史記／卷057","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷057","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷057&oldid=1569360","revision_